  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temp Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Temp Converter</h1>\n    <p class=\"formula\">°C → °F: x × 9/5 + 32 &nbsp;|&nbsp; °F → °C: (x − 32) × 5/9</p>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"temperature\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 25\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n      <select id=\"direction\">\n        <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius → Fahrenheit</option>\n        <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit → Celsius</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"convert\" type=\"button\">Convert</button>\n    <div class=\"output-wrap\">\n      <span class=\"output-label\">Result</span>\n      <output id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">--</output>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML structure with labeled controls and required IDs."
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --muted: #9a9a9a;\n  --border: #0f3460;\n  --radius: 0;\n  --font: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: var(--font);\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  padding: 24px 20px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 420px;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.5);\n}\nh1 {\n  font-size: 22px;\n  margin: 0 0 8px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n.formula {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  margin: 0 0 20px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n.field { margin-bottom: 16px; }\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: var(--text);\n}\ninput, select, button {\n  font-family: var(--font);\n  font-size: 18px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  width: 100%;\n  transition: border-color .1s, background .1s;\n}\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\ninput:hover, select:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }\nbutton {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #fff;\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  font-weight: bold;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\nbutton:hover { background: #ff5c7a; border-color: #ff5c7a; }\nbutton:active { transform: translate(2px, 2px); box-shadow: none; }\n.output-wrap {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  padding: 12px;\n}\n.output-label {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\noutput {\n  font-size: 24px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  h1 { font-size: 18px; }\n  .card { padding: 18px 14px; }\n}",
      "description": "Pixel-style theme with responsive layout and control states."
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const input = document.getElementById('temperature');\nconst direction = document.getElementById('direction');\nconst convertBtn = document.getElementById('convert');\nconst result = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction convert() {\n  const raw = input.value.trim();\n  if (raw === '') {\n    result.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  const x = Number(raw);\n  if (!Number.isFinite(x)) {\n    result.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  let out;\n  if (direction.value === 'c-to-f') {\n    out = x * 9 / 5 + 32;\n  } else {\n    out = (x - 32) * 5 / 9;\n  }\n  result.textContent = out.toFixed(2);\n}\n\nconvertBtn.addEventListener('click', convert);\ninput.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n  if (e.key === 'Enter') convert();\n});",
      "description": "Conversion logic with validation and two-decimal formatting."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel-Style Temperature Converter\n\nAn offline, pixel-styled temperature converter built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. No packages, imports, network requests, or storage.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a temperature in the text field.\n3. Choose a direction: Celsius → Fahrenheit or Fahrenheit → Celsius.\n4. Click **Convert** (or press Enter).\n5. The result appears with exactly two decimals and no unit suffix.\n\nInvalid, empty, or non-finite input displays exactly `Error`.\n\n## Formulas\n\n- Celsius to Fahrenheit: `x * 9/5 + 32`\n- Fahrenheit to Celsius: `(x - 32) * 5/9`\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — structure and labeled controls\n- `styles.css` — pixel-style theme, responsive layout, focus/hover/pressed states\n- `script.js` — conversion logic and validation\n- `README.md` — this document\n\n## Accessibility\n\nAll controls are keyboard accessible with visible focus indicators. The output uses `aria-live=\"polite\"`.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- Fully offline; no external assets or dependencies.\n- Works from 360px width.\n- Styling does not override required IDs, text, or behavior.",
      "description": "Project documentation with usage, formulas, and file overview."
    }
  ]
}